as {na} and C1 being a consonant, and define another rafsi R2 whose first
consonant is C2. If C1+R2 is morphologically acceptable, then to form lujvo
R1+R2 we need a y in between C1 and C2, even if C1+C2 is an acceptable
consonant cluster, to avoid fragmentation into M1 C1+R2?

